answer.short:
$k=\frac1{16}$;
$$f(x)=\begin{cases}\frac{4+x}{16}&-4\le x\le0,\\\frac{4-x}{16}&0\le x\le4.\end{cases}$$
The sketch joins $(-4,0)$, $(0,\frac14)$ and $(4,0)$ with straight segments.

